      "lines": [
        {
          "code": "hua_wenshizhe_office_001",
          "lineType": "narration",
          "speaker": null,
          "content": "1951年春，合校大会后的一个傍晚。你抱着作业本走过文学院二楼，半掩的办公室里传来争论和算盘珠的脆响。",
          "portraitRef": null,
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 0,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "hua_wenshizhe_office_002",
          "lineType": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "老教授",
          "content": "老华啊，纸张报价又涨了。办这样一本大刊物，印刷费就是个无底洞。",
          "portraitRef": "hua/professor/worried",
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 1,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "hua_wenshizhe_office_003",
          "lineType": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "华岗",
          "content": "难处我知道。但越是这个时候，越要把新中国自己的学术阵地建起来。",
          "portraitRef": "hua/hua_gang/serious",
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 2,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "hua_wenshizhe_office_004",
          "lineType": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "华岗",
          "content": "经费我来想办法，大家手头宽裕就凑一凑。稿子靠我们自己写，不计稿酬。",
          "portraitRef": "hua/hua_gang/determined",
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 3,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "hua_wenshizhe_office_005",
          "lineType": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "另一位老师",
          "content": "没有刊号，不能通过邮局发行，创刊以后又怎么送到读者手里？",
          "portraitRef": "hua/professor/thinking",
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 4,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "hua_wenshizhe_office_006",
          "lineType": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "华岗",
          "content": "先寄给全国各大学的朋友代售。路是走出来的，学术阵地也一样。",
          "portraitRef": "hua/hua_gang/pleased",
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 5,
          "condition": null
        },
        {
          "code": "hua_wenshizhe_office_007",
          "lineType": "narration",
          "speaker": null,
          "content": "桌上堆满稿纸，搪瓷茶缸旁只有一盏昏黄的灯。你忽然明白，一本刊物的诞生也可以像一场艰苦的建设。",
          "portraitRef": null,
          "effectRef": null,
          "orderIndex": 6,
          "condition": null
        }
      ],
      "choices": []
    },
